   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Where a read turns around.** Same object, answered at a different layer per configuration: 1 page cache → 2 kmod chunk table (no upcall) → 3 daemon disk cache (upcall) → 4 daemon → S3 (MinIO). `ref` rows are s3fs-fuse. Value = open + read whole file + close, log scale, µs. Numbers: `docs/journal/benchmark-results.md` §18.48 (`scripts/bench-layer-latency.sh`). Time series below are Prometheus; the shaded bands are the runs (annotations tagged `layer-latency`)."
   }
